# Line endings
#
# The repo stores LF and checkouts get LF, on every machine. Without this,
# editing on Windows silently rewrites whole files to CRLF and every commit
# looks like it changed all 7,000 lines — which makes review impossible and
# guarantees merge conflicts between collaborators.
#
# If your working copy is already CRLF, fix the index in place with:
#   git add --renormalize .
# (that only rewrites git's index, not your files)

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never transform these
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
